  "description": "Designed for easy access and ultimate cruising comfort, Chatham Rev+ 2 makes every ride feel like a sunny-day stroll. With its low-step frame and relaxed geometry, hopping on and off is simple—perfect for errands, commutes, or just soaking up the coast. The powerful upgraded Ananda e-system pairs a 500W rear hub motor with a seamlessly integrated 48V/500Wh battery, giving you up to 75 miles of range and the freedom to ride farther with less effort. Whether you’re getting a boost from one of four pedal assist levels or going full throttle, this electric beach cruiser delivers smooth, confident performance. 3-inch-thick puncture-resistant tires absorb the bumps in your path, while full-coverage fenders protect from splashes when the roads get messy. An integrated headlight and included taillight with brake function keep you visible from dusk to dawn, so every ride ends as comfortably as it began.",
